    "updated_at": "2019-10-15T03:35:30Z",
    "body": "I also faced a similar problem. In my case, the directory structure:\r\n```\r\n/home/poi/test (git repo)\r\n└── org -> /home/poi/org/\r\n```\r\nconfiguration:\r\n```toml\r\nprompt_order = [\r\n    \"username\",\r\n    \"directory\",\r\n    \"git_branch\",\r\n    \"git_status\",\r\n    \"cmd_duration\",\r\n    \"line_break\",\r\n    \"jobs\",\r\n    \"character\",\r\n]\r\n\r\n[directory]\r\nfish_style_pwd_dir_length = 1\r\ntruncate_to_repo = true\r\n```\r\nand result:\r\n```\r\n~/test\r\n~> ls\r\norg@\r\n\r\n~/test\r\n~> cd org\r\n\r\n~/t/opoi/test/org\r\n~> pwd\r\n/home/poi/test/org\r\n\r\n~/t/opoi/test/org\r\n~>\r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
